ass=\"text_table_td\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\">X</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\">Exclusive game</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\">X</td> </tr> </table></div> <b>Goals <i><span style=\"font-size:14px\">(as of May 2, 2015)</span></i></b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Trebuchet MS\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">As the number of patronage it grows, new rewards for participating will be unlocked. No matter when you've made your contribution: get all the goals that have been unlocked at the end of patronage. As steps are being surpassing goals we'll be revealing new ones.</span></span></span><ul><li><b>\u20ac 20,000.</b> Bookmark lupine exclusive issue for all patrons. <b>PASSED!</b></li> <li><b>\u20ac 35,000.</b> Bandanna cloth (handkerchief large) Commemorative patronage for all patrons. <b>PASSED!</b></li> <li><b>\u20ac 50,000.</b> Improved screen. Narrator screen is printed in hardcover laminating 2 mm (hardcover) instead of cardboard of 1 mm (as planned and reflecting the English version) for all patrons whose rewards include the screen. In addition, all levels that do not include the screen will receive a PDF copy of it.</li> <li><b>\u20ac 65,000.</b> Glossary on paper. All patrons (except Parentela level) will receive a printed copy in full color glossy Glossary Basic H20.<b>\u20ac 80,000.</b> The Scalper. The first supplement 20th anniversary Werewolf completely free for patrons: pdf for patrons of Kin level and more pdf paper for everyone else. <b>PASSED!</b></li> <li><b><b>\u20ac 95,000.</b> </b>Notebook character sheets. Character sheets customized for each tribe, plus a special sheet of four pages in a notebook format staple forever keep them safe. It includes electronic version for all patrons.</li> <li><b><b>\u20ac 110 000.</b> </b>Certificate of limited numbered edition. Patronage packs include a certificate of authenticity with dry-laid stamp printed in heavy paper (or similar quality) signed one by one by Bill Bridges, editor of the original line of Werewolf and author of the 20th anniversary edition.</li> <li><b><b>\u20ac 125,000.</b> </b>Embossed Notebook. A notebook (A6) with leatherette cover embossed with a commemorative symbol of patronage.</li> </ul>Now, on to the participation part of this post:<br /> <br /> The translation of W20 from English to Spanish is underway. However, the translators are looking for input!<br /> &quot;Wyld&quot; apparently doesn't translate very well, and they're looking for suggestions!<br /> <br /> SO, if you're fluent in Spanish, or know someone who is and is a fan of W:tA and would like to give input, check out the Facebook page, read the info below, and submit the Google Document form to help out!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/QueremosElV20PublicadoEnPapelYEnEspanol/photos/a.469774686434522.1073741826.469533346458656/791708347574486/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.facebook.com/QueremosElV...1708347574486/</a><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#141823\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Muchos fans de Hombre Lobo se est\u00e1n preguntando cu\u00e1nto falta para Hombre Lobo: El Apocalipsis 20\u00ba Aniversario. Pues bien, \u00a1ya no falta mucho tiempo! La traducci\u00f3n principal lleva varias semanas terminada y ahora estamos con las correcciones, para despu\u00e9s pasar a la maquetaci\u00f3n. Estimamos que el mecenazgo dar\u00eda comienzo en abril.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#141823\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Entretanto, nos hemos encontrado con un problema de traducci\u00f3n tan c</span></span><span style=\"color:#141823\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">ontrovertido dentro del equipo de Biblioteca Oscura que hemos decidido resolverlo con una encuesta entre los fans: \u00bfc\u00f3mo traducir\u00edas &quot;the Wyld&quot;?<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/16zsEXjxA8NfODapkdLonXvWoDLKbHMZ1N0tzjBDkXEU/viewform?usp=send_form\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/forms/d/16zs...?usp=send_form</a><br /> <br /> \u00bfHacia qu\u00e9 lado se inclinar\u00e1 la balanza? \u00a1Participa con tu opini\u00f3n!</span></span> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">- Arthur &quot;Torakhan&quot; Dreese <span style=\"color:silver\"><b>David &quot;Wall-of-Text&quot; Tealdeer</b> - US2012070036\u200b - Grand Rapids, MI</span><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img855/1250/jv8k.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nmeqe3m\" target=\"_blank\">V:tM 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/pavtnjj\" target=\"_blank\">Hunters Hunted II</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/l3hjgjt\" target=\"_blank\">Anarchs Unbound</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/mxyvsy9\" target=\"_blank\">W:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/k5qe4j4\" target=\"_blank\">W20 Changing Breeds</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/m64m9o5\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3rd Edition</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/qxkop7m\" target=\"_blank\">M:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nd6kms2\" target=\"_blank\">W20BotW</a></div>","edited":{"userid":780,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/780-torakhan","user":"Torakhan","date":". 06-07-2015, 12:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum