emprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img923/595/D73cyJ.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> That's a silver foil-stamped brown box (A heavy textured card board), &quot;<u>Hombre Lobo: El Apocalipsis</u>&quot; (A traditionally-printed H20 book with die-cut cover), a bandanna with a wolf skull, an embossed journal with cream pages, custom dice with the H20 glyph for the 10, A bookmark, A heavy stock ST screen, &quot;<u>El Desollador</u>&quot; (&quot;The Skinner&quot;), &quot;<u>Cuaderno de Hojas de Personate</u>&quot; (a bound book of full-color character sheets for each Tribe), and &quot;<u>Glosario H20 Basico</u>&quot; (amazingly a Basic H20 glossary of terms and definitions... in Spanish and parts in English too, plus some new artwork too!) Oh, and the numbered certificate of authenticity!<br /> <br /> To be honest, I'm tempted to find out if Onyx Path Publishing would consider translating and offering the Glosario H20 Basico in English. ^.^","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">- Arthur &quot;Torakhan&quot; Dreese <span style=\"color:silver\"><b>David &quot;Wall-of-Text&quot; Tealdeer</b> - US2012070036\u200b - Grand Rapids, MI</span><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img855/1250/jv8k.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nmeqe3m\" target=\"_blank\">V:tM 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/pavtnjj\" target=\"_blank\">Hunters Hunted II</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/l3hjgjt\" target=\"_blank\">Anarchs Unbound</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/mxyvsy9\" target=\"_blank\">W:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/k5qe4j4\" target=\"_blank\">W20 Changing Breeds</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/m64m9o5\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3rd Edition</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/qxkop7m\" target=\"_blank\">M:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nd6kms2\" target=\"_blank\">W20BotW</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/780-torakhan","name":"Torakhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar780_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"576"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-10T23:02:04-08:00","id":845487,"title":"","content":"Ha! I recognize that bandanna anywhere since I got it from Monsterpalooza one year. That Wolf Skull Bandanna is done by <a href=\"http://www.missmonster.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Miss Monster</a>!<br /> <br /> How many pages does the &quot;Glosario H20 Basico&quot; have? And what new artwork do some of the books have, Torakhan?<br /> Can you add stuff to pledges? Or is the whole thing already over?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1137,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","user":"Laughing Hyena","date":". 03-11-2016, 02:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-12T18:03:18-08:00","id":846354,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Laughing Hyena</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/401378-spanish-werewolf-the-apocalypse-20th-anniversary-and-deluxe-edition?p=845487#post845487\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ha! I recognize that bandanna anywhere since I got it from Monsterpalooza one year. That Wolf Skull Bandanna is done by <a href=\"http://www.missmonster.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Miss Monster</a>!<br /> <br /> How many pages does the &quot;Glosario H20 Basico&quot; have? And what new artwork do some of the books have, Torakhan?<br /> Can you add stuff to pledges? Or is the whole thing already over?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> El Glosario has 48 pages, and yeah you could add stuff to pledges, but only when it was live. I cannot speak about the art differences, as i don't have the english version... still. :3<br /> It was pretty neat how it was handled, to be honest. I was certainly surprised to see them doing it,ascurrently there's not much newly printed c/nWoD in spanish, but Masquerade got a lot of love back in the day (White Wolf treated us nicely giving LaSombra to Spain, among other things xD) and V20 was succesfull too, one thing i wouldn't have bet into, taking into account La Factoria fiasco.<br /> <br /> Ayway, is really nice to have this gorgeous piece of work in Spanish... and by the way, thank you,Torakhan, for your support! Hopefully we'll see more things like this in the near future! ^^","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Userhat Aegpts Vlrs. </span><span style=\"color:#996633\">Coren &quot;Ojos de Fuego&quot;. </span><span style=\"color:#666699\">Mithrael. </span><span style=\"color:#ffcc00\">Menehet.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1349-phersus","name":"Phersus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1349_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-13T04:30:23-07:00","id":846519,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Laughing Hyena</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/401378-spanish-werewolf-the-apocalypse-20th-anniversary-and-deluxe-edition?p=845487#post845487\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And what new artwork do some of the books have, Torakhan?</div> </div> </div> </div>The artists are:<br /> <b>Adrian Rio</b> <a href=\"https://www.artstation.com/artist/senex\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.artstation.com/artist/senex</a><br /> <b>Carlos Garcia Revilla</b> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/cgarciarevilla\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.facebook.com/cgarciarevilla</a> (Some of his pieces seen here are on his Facebook page.)<br /> <img src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img921/8995/GBfWme.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox 